          }
        },
        "selector": {
          "type": "FragmentSelector",
          "value": "xywh=pixel:505.98590087890625,1130.609375,4580.969177246094,1935.88330078125",
          "conformsTo": "http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/"
        }
      },
      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "verso, address",
          "value": "<p>To my lord and patron Ab\u016b Man\u1e63\u016br Dosa ben Joshua, the \u1e25aver [fellow; an honorific], al-L\u0101dhiq\u012b, may God prolong his life and perpetuate his honor and support him.</p>\n<p>From Sahl ibn \u1e24\u0101tim [in] Fust\u0101t</p>\n<p>Qa\u1e63r al-Sh\u0101ma\u2018, Mak\u012bn Alley, may it arrive with the help of God.</p>\n<p>To the partner of the [Arabic unclear], Eli the \u1e24alab\u012b [the Aleppan]</p>\n<p>[Letter carriers]</p>\n<p>Al-\u1e24asan Ibr\u0101h\u012bm and his son</p>\n<p>To Asad ibn Mu\u1e25ammad ibn Ab\u012b \u2018Iy\u0101d</p>\n<p>May his reply be gotten quickly, God willing.</p>\n<p></p>",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
        "sc:supplementing",
        "translating"
      ],
      "schema:position": 2
    },
